bvp_n21_feed_retries:  ds.l 1

        section code,code
; berryVP 9.2 / VPr9 - Development build 527
; MichiB210 + ChatGPT - 23.09.2026
; Public executable name: berryVP
;
; mkvr7_CLEAN.s
; Keys: 0/Esc = stop, Space = pause / resume (toggle), C = clean restart into VideoCore/HVS cinema mode.
; MKV-only cleanup based on hardware-confirmed VPv182MKV.
; Legacy ISO-BMFF parser/feeder/audio/timing code removed; MKV behavior retained.
; PiStorm / Emu68 H264 RGB player - V9 based on hardware-proven V9 192x144/max25
; H264 MMAL bounded-memory streaming: dynamic frame count until decoder OUTPUT EOS -> native HAM6 RGB
; V10P: V10G playback path + first-MMAL-ERRO payload/context diagnostic and immediate controlled stop
; Speed experiment: TEST49-identical adaptive HAM decisions through Fast-RAM LUTs.
; Amiga 500 + PiStorm + Raspberry Pi 3A+
;
; Based on the working TEST09 firmware-init path plus the VCHIQ connect
; sequence used by Linux/RusPiRo:
;   local slot 34, CONNECT header, tx_pos=8, trigger VC, poll remote tx_pos.
;
; V10P target: keep V10G playback/restart semantics unchanged and turn 1.mkv's ERRO flood
; into one useful diagnostic. The first MMAL ERROR event is decoded (4-byte MMAL_STATUS_T),
; the last submitted MKV/MMAL input context is printed, then streaming stops immediately.
; No codec, demux, frame-flag, buffer-size or restart policy is changed in this test.

        section code,code

